# ── Local-only artifacts (never commit) ──
# terraform.tfstate should never be committed even though it's not in
# Terraform/ (that dir's own .tfstate is covered by the Terraform section
# below) — this is a stray root-level state file, not something to publish.
/terraform.tfstate
/helm.exe
/kubectl.exe
